[Bb]We know our old [F/A]self was crucified with [Gm]him
The body of [Eb]sin is rendered powerless [Bb]now
No longer [F/A]slaves to the weight of our [Gm]sin
For anyone who [Eb]died is set free some[F]how
{end_of_verse}

{start_of_chorus: Chorus}
